    '<p><b>Negative predictive value</b> is the proportion of correct ': '<p><b>음성 예측도</b>는 음성 예측 중 '
    negatives, TN&nbsp;/&nbsp;(TN&nbsp;+&nbsp;FN).</p>: 올바른 것의 비율입니다, TN&nbsp;/&nbsp;(TN&nbsp;+&nbsp;FN).</p>
